Hi <%= @user.full_name.presence || "there" %>,

Your elected representation on Sway has been updated following recent election results or redistricting in your area:

<% @reassignments.each do |reassignment| %>
<% case reassignment.reassignment_type %>
<% when "successor_seeded" %>
* <%= reassignment.legislator&.full_name %> has succeeded <%= reassignment.previous_legislator&.full_name %> as your representative for <%= reassignment.district&.name %>.
<% when "district_changed" %>
* Your voting district has shifted from <%= reassignment.previous_district&.name %> to <%= reassignment.district&.name %>, represented by <%= reassignment.legislator&.full_name %>.
<% when "vacant_seat" %>
* <%= reassignment.previous_legislator&.full_name %>'s term has concluded, and the seat for <%= reassignment.district&.name %> is currently vacant.
<% when "vacancy_filled" %>
* <%= reassignment.legislator&.full_name %> has been seated to represent <%= reassignment.district&.name %>.
<% else %>
* Your representative for <%= reassignment.district&.name %> has been updated.
<% end %>
<% end %>

View your representatives at: https://sway.vote/legislators

---
You received this email because you opted into representative updates on Sway.
Manage notification preferences: https://sway.vote/notifications
